{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and subscription upgrades using one shared discount and tax calculation. Percentage discounts round half-up to the nearest cent. Fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal. Orders record the promo code, actual discount, and discounted subtotal.\n\nBoth paths raise `ValidationError` for unknown, stacked, expired, or ineligible codes before recording a charge. Upgrade replay checks include `promo_code` and `as_of` and return the original entry even if the promo is later edited.\n\n**All 14 tests passed**, including five new promo tests. `run_checks.py` exited 0."}}
